#####################################################################
# nc12_sharp_h0p1.lgi
#
# polygon : saw_sharp.poly
# h       : 0.1
# expect  : recovered
# known    : element centroids outside the polygon
# expected : 2 slivers at reflex corners after the binned vertex sort (00README finding 5)
#
# EXPECT:
#   Nonconvex WARNING. Clip recovers the outline.
#   Mesh area should match polygon area closely.
#   Zero elements with centroid outside the polygon.
#
# NOTE:
#   Same polygon as nc08, at the resolution of nc01.
#   tooth half width / h = 4.17 (nc08: 1.39). Teeth are well
#   resolved, so by the calibration from nc01-nc07 this should
#   recover.
#
#   nc08 at h = 0.3 recovered within tolerance but was missing 4
#   notch tip vertices, each bridged. This deck shows whether
#   the missing notch tips go away at fine resolution or persist.
#   If they persist, the cause is in the sampler, not in h.
#
#   KNOWN FAILURE since Oct 18 2026 (user accepted): the Poisson
#   driver now sorts the vertices on binned coordinates before
#   connect (poi_driver.f), not on xic yic zic. Same
#   points, same areas to 4 digits, but two triangles now end with
#   their centroids just outside the polygon, at the reflex corners
#   (13.33, 1) and (22.5, 1), where the sampler places no vertex:
#   2.7e-3 and 4.4e-4 outside (6e-3 and 1e-3 x the shortest polygon
#   edge). Each has two vertices on the outline and one inside it
#   (0.04, 0.08 from the outline), so the clip ran correctly and the
#   smooth;recon passes AFTER the clip moved that vertex or flipped
#   an edge across the corner (nc06's explanation 2). Those passes
#   depend on the vertex order; the old order passed by chance.
#   If this stops happening the result is FIXED: remove the known /
#   expected lines then.
#####################################################################
read / avs / saw_sharp.poly / mo_polygon
cmo / select / mo_polygon
createpts / poisson_disk / 2d_polygon / mo_pts / mo_polygon &
      / 0.1 / connect
cmo / select / mo_pts
quality
dump / avs / out_nc12_sharp_h0p1.inp / mo_pts
finish
